## Slide 7 — Technology, trust and safeguards

## AI explains. Code calculates. Evidence supports.

Data layer

Collect company financial statements and relevant business information from traceable sources.

Python screening engine

Calculate ratios deterministically and compare them with the selected methodology.

AI explanation layer

